# ---- entities: machines ----
ent-OxydRdConsole = Moebius R&D console
    .desc = Central research console. Links to the destructive analyzer and fabrication machines.

ent-OxydDestructiveAnalyzer = destructive analyzer
    .desc = A hollow chamber that disassembles objects to extract research data.

ent-OxydProtolathe = protolathe
    .desc = Fabricates prototypes from designs unlocked by the R&D console.

ent-OxydCircuitImprinter = circuit imprinter
    .desc = Prints machine and computer circuit boards.

ent-OxydMechfab = exosuit fabricator
    .desc = Produces robotic parts and prosthetics for the robotics lab.

ent-OxydExplosionWatcher = explosion watcher beacon
    .desc = A shock-resistant beacon that banks research data from recorded blasts.

